</li><li class="SiteFooter-module__V7EeQW__mainItem"><div class="SiteFooter-module__V7EeQW__mainItemInner"><a class="Link-module__ck364G__link SiteFooter-module__V7EeQW__mainLink" href="/contact-us">Contact Us</a></div></li><li class="SiteFooter-module__V7EeQW__acknowledgement"><p><b>Land Acknowledgement</b></p><p>CreateTO acknowledges that we are on the traditional territory of many nations including the Mississaugas of the Credit, the Anishinaabeg, the Chippewa, the Haudenosaunee and the Wendat peoples and is now home to many diverse First Nations, Inuit and Métis peoples.</p><p><a class="Link-module__ck364G__link Action-module__4gXbIq__action Action-module__4gXbIq__action__isSmallSecondary" target="_self" href="/about-us/land-acknowledgement"><span class="Action-module__4gXbIq__inner"><span aria-hidden="true" class="IconAction-module__LaarvW__wrapper IconAction-module__LaarvW__wrapper__isClear IconAction-module__LaarvW__wrapper__isSizeXs Action-module__4gXbIq__icon Action-module__4gXbIq__icon__left"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-module__DNOlPq__icon" viewBox="0 0 32 32" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path class="" d="m16.7 23.5-1.4-1.4 5-5.1H8v-2h12.3l-5-5.1 1.4-1.4L24 16z"></path></svg></span><span class="Action-module__4gXbIq__text">Learn more</span></span></a></p></li></ul></div></div><div class="container SiteFooter-module__V7EeQW__section"><div class="SiteFooter-module__V7EeQW__social SiteFooter-module__V7EeQW__section"><span class="SiteFooter-module__V7EeQW__socialLabel">Stay up to date on</span><ul class="SiteFooter-module__V7EeQW__socialLinks"><li class="SiteFooter-module__V7EeQW__socialItem"><a class="Link-module__ck364G__link SiteFooter-module__V7EeQW__socialLink Action-module__4gXbIq__action Action-module__4gXbIq__action__isSimple" href="https://twitter.com/_createto" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><span class="Action-module__4gXbIq__inner"><span aria-hidden="true" class="IconAction-module__LaarvW__wrapper IconAction-module__LaarvW__wrapper_