hippewa, the Haudenosaunee and the Wendat peoples and is now home to many diverse First Nations, Inuit and Métis peoples.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Learn more","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"/about-us/land-acknowledgement","uuid":"8f58303c-9775-46e6-a357-12f863a43c78","anchor":null,"target":"_self","linktype":"story","story":{"name":"Land Acknowledgement","id":481725,"uuid":"8f58303c-9775-46e6-a357-12f863a43c78","slug":"land-acknowledgement","url":"about-us/land-acknowledgement","full_slug":"about-us/land-acknowledgement","_stopResolving":true}}}]}]}]}},"frontNews":{"externalSource":null,"id":"312e4766-0d4f-430f-8118-58730bb45031","href":"/news/createto-s-2025-annual-report","initiatives":["a22c3ccc-cfc0-48c9-800d-345fc4ed58af","dc2d2b20-0f1d-4798-882e-b12476f95c0d","4900b30b-0716-4f57-9936-a03d063c0995","7ece5bec-2963-4f33-99ac-55ae45e0ea5d","3ece4064-4ca5-4fbc-8138-595c345cbcf2"],"isExternal":false,"title":"CreateTO's 2025 Annual Report","createdAt":"2026-04-27T14:39:59.897Z","updatedAt":"2026-04-27T14:51:39.576Z","excerpt":"Building the city we love requires consistency and a long‑term view. This past year, we continued our work supporting City Divisions, Agencies and Corporations, delivering affordable housing and advancing the transformation of the Port Lands. Our 2025 Annual Report reflects steady progress in using public real estate to meet Toronto’s evolving needs.","tags":[],"image":{"src":"https://a-us.storyblok.com/f/1017201/1200x627/d41395f46b/annual-report-3-4.png","alt":"","title":"","focus":""}},"page":{"name":"Home","created_at":"2023-10-26T17:45:28.675Z","published_at":"2026-04-10T17:11:29.022Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T20:15:20.151Z","id":481721,"uuid":"10ed1f5c-d76e-4e8a-931f-67f466154c6d","content":{"_uid":"90767df7-83a6-4c5d-94fe-c1c719a2906f","hero":[{"_uid":"0e8e613a-e324-47d2-9835-c8f766b6ef82","slides":[{"_uid":"3754361b-4b80-47ef-a638-1eecbc6954b2","text":"Building the city we love","m